#: ../../tools/pdc_tools.rst:143 5a8e66e59fb5407c9665a9665937bb91
msgid ""
"**Description**: List all programs and projects in the NCI Proteomics "
"Data Commons (PDC). Returns the complete hierarchy of programs (CPTAC, "
"ICPC, APOLLO, CBTN, Georgetown, Broad Institute, etc.) and their "
"constituent projects. Each program represents a major cancer proteomics "
"initiative, and projects within a program correspond to specific cancer "
"studies or sub-studies. Use program/project IDs to explore associated "
"studies."
msgstr ""

